                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>	; or (v)	a company in the capacity of a trustee of an AMIT, being a company that is liable to be assessed and to pay tax under paragraph 276-105(2)(b) or (c) of the <i>Income Tax Assessment Act 1997</i>.</p>
